    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Landsword</i></strong> is a top-down mecha shooter with a heavy emphasis on destruction and gameplay that combines elements from classic shoot 'em ups with contemporary action-stealth games\u00a0while retaining an arcade feeling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Combat</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engagements are fast-paced and action-packed, balancing aggressive shooting with strategic dodging of enemy fire. Enemies all have distinct attack patterns and behaviors, prompting players to consider how to best approach and destroy each threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/e72853736f08a03f625a6ddb4f8b48d6.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/e72853736f08a03f625a6ddb4f8b48d6.webm?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/072568d24dc931e7efac4ce215a056b0.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/072568d24dc931e7efac4ce215a056b0.webm?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/c2e351623913a4307a741ef02f79d05e.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/c2e351623913a4307a741ef02f79d05e.gif?t=1754534334\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/969ee03a50b5a0a90112f92c4efb642e.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" width=488 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/969ee03a50b5a0a90112f92c4efb642e.webm?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/969ee03a50b5a0a90112f92c4efb642e.mp4?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Terrain destruction</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Players are free to revel in large-scale collateral damage as they carve a path through each level. Every stage has fully destructible environments, including vehicles, props, and structures that persist throughout a mission. What begins as a dense urban battlefield may become a smoldering ruin by the mission\u2019s end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/424d740877af61c5c055732af92e714a.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" width=488 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/424d740877af61c5c055732af92e714a.webm?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/424d740877af61c5c055732af92e714a.mp4?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Customization</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/9721f02a4adfc661403408e6320e8e88.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/9721f02a4adfc661403408e6320e8e88.webm?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and upgrade your maneuver crawler with a wide variety of different parts and weapons before each mission. Different loadouts compliment different missions and environments,  changing the style of combat and movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/9f41764122431c3b2edf2efb4b6ce393.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/9f41764122431c3b2edf2efb4b6ce393.webm?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
