ture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/969ee03a50b5a0a90112f92c4efb642e.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" width=488 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/969ee03a50b5a0a90112f92c4efb642e.webm?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/969ee03a50b5a0a90112f92c4efb642e.mp4?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Terrain destruction</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Players are free to revel in large-scale collateral damage as they carve a path through each level. Every stage has fully destructible environments, including vehicles, props, and structures that persist throughout a mission. What begins as a dense urban battlefield may become a smoldering ruin by the mission\u2019s end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/424d740877af61c5c055732af92e714a.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" width=488 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/424d740877af61c5c055732af92e714a.webm?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/424d740877af61c5c055732af92e714a.mp4?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Customization</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/9721f02a4adfc661403408e6320e8e88.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/9721f02a4adfc661403408e6320e8e88.webm?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and upgrade your maneuver crawler with a wide variety of different parts and weapons before each mission. Different loadouts compliment different missions and environments,  changing the style of combat and movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/9f41764122431c3b2edf2efb4b6ce393.poster.avif?t=1754534334\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695630/extras/9f41764122431c3b2edf2efb4b6ce393.webm?t=1754534334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
